    "detailed_description": "It's a very very short game using lattice boltzmann method.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Control</h2>Use the mouse to drag and move the oil droplets, aiming to gather the floating oil into a cluster.<br>You can leisurely collect the floating oil or challenge yourself to see how fast you can gather them.<br>That's it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background story</h2>After finishing the ramen, you suddenly feel inspired to gather the oil floating on the surface of the soup. <br>As you lightly touch the water with your chopsticks, tiny ripples form, causing the oil droplets to merge with each other.<br>This process brings you a sense of relaxation and contentment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909480/extras/dad71d2ff15701ae6c76a8b49ca0cd61.avif?t=1714325314\" width=570 height=588 /></span><br><br>credit:<br>Icon by Freepik from flaticon<br>Image by Lindsey Sewell from Pixabay<br>Image by Papus_sss from Pixabay<br>Image by Clker-Free-Vector-Images from Pixabay<br>Image by BilliTheCat from Pixabay<br>Image by andrease160578 from Pixabay<br>music is called feel my mind<br><br>Streaming Terms and Conditions:<br>I give permission to distribute videos using this game on YouTube and other platforms and to monetize them.<br>Also, I would really appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam store page in the video summary section of your distribution.",
